{"id":"n14145-1-8","stage":3,"title":"예산 · 预算","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14145-1-8-1","ko":"이번 동창회에서 식사비가 예산보다 많이 나왔대.","zh":"据说这次同学聚会的餐饮费用比预算高出很多。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동창회에서","meaning":"校友会","explanation":"동창회：校友会；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"동창회","audio":"/audio/144b00af1ad84ad8336d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48106","senseId":"1","lemma":"동창회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식사비가","meaning":"餐费","explanation":"식사비：餐费；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"식사비","audio":"/audio/76c0344f16bd96b3ea07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:식사비:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"식사비","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"예산보다","meaning":"预算","explanation":"예산：预算；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"예산","audio":"/audio/c4cc2c7d2a86dcc65fad.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14145","senseId":"1","lemma":"예산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나왔대.","meaning":"产生，获得","explanation":"나오다：产生，获得；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"17","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"144b00af1ad84ad8","term":"동창회","zh":"校友会","audio":"/audio/144b00af1ad84ad8336d.mp3","entryId":"48106","definition":"从同一个学校毕业的人们举行的聚会。","pronunciation":["동창회","동창훼"]},{"id":"76c0344f16bd96b3","term":"식사비","zh":"餐费","audio":"/audio/76c0344f16bd96b3ea07.mp3","definition":"用餐的费用。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c4cc2c7d2a86dcc6","term":"예산","zh":"预算","audio":"/audio/c4cc2c7d2a86dcc65fad.mp3","entryId":"14145","definition":"提前计算定好需要的内容；或指那样的内容。","pronunciation":["예ː산"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"产生，获得","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"被给予应该收到的钱款或被征收税金等。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cf43c7bd4f53d0ffe09d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14145-1-8-2","ko":"그럼 회비를 더 걷어야 하지 않아?","zh":"那不是得再多收点会费吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회비를","meaning":"会费","explanation":"회비：会费；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"회비","audio":"/audio/92363dd7fa11820d8a3c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88133","senseId":"1","lemma":"회비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걷어야","meaning":"收，收取，征收","explanation":"걷다：收，收取，征收；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15933","senseId":"3","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하지","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않아?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"92363dd7fa11820d","term":"회비","zh":"会费","audio":"/audio/92363dd7fa11820d8a3c.mp3","entryId":"88133","definition":"组织内的会员交的钱，以供组织使用。","pronunciation":["회ː비","훼ː비"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"收，收取，征收","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"15933","definition":"从多个人那里拿到钱或东西，把它们放在一起。","pronunciation":["걷따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/cc46831ee7e5247b846e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.949,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14145","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":106,"sequenceScore":2.7757,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["据说这次同学聚会的餐饮费用比预算高出很多。","那不是得再多收点会费吗？","那只小鸡为什么总跟着玩偶走啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["据说这次同学聚会的餐饮费用比预算高出很多。","那不是得再多收点会费吗？","那只小鸡为什么总跟着玩偶走啊？"],"answer":1}]}
